    "content": '## Float and Decimal\n\nFor specific numeric types:\n\n```powerfx\n// Decimal (default, higher precision)\nDecimal( "123.456789" )\n\n// Float (larger range, less precision)\nFloat( "1e308" )\n```\n\n---',
