  "Upper": {
    "name": "Upper",
    "category": "text",
    "source_file": "text/string-functions.md",
    "content": '## Upper, Lower, Proper Functions\n\nChange text case.\n\n### Syntax\n\n```powerfx\nUpper( String )     // ALL UPPERCASE\nLower( String )     // all lowercase\nProper( String )    // Title Case\n```\n\n### Examples\n\n```powerfx\nUpper( "hello" )                  // "HELLO"\nLower( "HELLO" )                  // "hello"\nProper( "hello world" )           // "Hello World"\nProper( "mcdonald" )              // "Mcdonald" (not McDonald)\n```\n\n---',
    "sources": [
      "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/power-fx/reference/function-len"
    ]
  },
